{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794815547037,"sessionID":"ses_e1ca84ea7ffeYndeEpFMNWYowo","part":{"partID":"prt_1e357d346002plMDNyM4kHqEOQ","sessionID":"ses_e1ca84ea7ffeYndeEpFMNWYowo","messageID":"msg_1e357b65d0012FW7xgstDeb28x","type":"tool","id":"call_56a867e0f1e64395b7c8a757","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-brief-6.txt"},"output":"Read file specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-brief-6.txt, lines 1-1\n1: Code review pass six of command surfacing. Scope: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-scope-6.txt lists files as area TAB path. Your lineage label is the last folder of config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir: scorer-6 reviews area scorer, arena-config-6 area arena-config, merge-docs-6 area merge-docs. Read each diff with the command on the scope file's first line. scorer covers the heredoc redirect fix, the start shape split and the rule that a document read with no checkout write is a lookup, not a start. arena-config covers the per-run TMPDIR in vitest.config.ts and the arena builder's repository listing. merge-docs covers this branch's net change to files a merge with main resolved: check that nothing main added was lost and that each claim is true of the code. Do not re-report these recorded limits unless you show a new input that breaks them: a node -e arrow inside escaped quotes still reads as a redirect; isolation-check.sh is macOS only; started of offered cannot be rebuilt from readOnly; older goal rows keep old-rule figures; turn duration, the OpenCode delivery receipt and a longer cap are declined. Every finding is P0, P1 or P2 with file:line and a concrete input that shows it. HOLDOUT RULE: never open command-prompts.jsonl, holdout-prompts.jsonl or behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl except through jq 'del(.prompt)', never run git diff, show or log -p over a path that includes them without the pathspecs ':(exclude)**/command-prompts.jsonl' ':(exclude)**/holdout-prompts.jsonl' ':(exclude)**/behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl', never run score-command-transcripts.mjs --summary, and never print session text from a CLI session store. Never read or create .skilled/hooks/hook-flags.env. The reviewer changes no code and writes only inside its lineage folder.","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-brief-6.txt, lines 1-1\n1: Code review pass six of command surfacing. Scope: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-scope-6.txt lists files as area TAB path. Your lineage label is the last folder of config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir: scorer-6 reviews area scorer, arena-config-6 area arena-config, merge-docs-6 area merge-docs. Read each diff with the command on the scope file's first line. scorer covers the heredoc redirect fix, the start shape split and the rule that a document read with no checkout write is a lookup, not a start. arena-config covers the per-run TMPDIR in vitest.config.ts and the arena builder's repository listing. merge-docs covers this branch's net change to files a merge with main resolved: check that nothing main added was lost and that each claim is true of the code. Do not re-report these recorded limits unless you show a new input that breaks them: a node -e arrow inside escaped quotes still reads as a redirect; isolation-check.sh is macOS only; started of offered cannot be rebuilt from readOnly; older goal rows keep old-rule figures; turn duration, the OpenCode delivery receipt and a longer cap are declined. Every finding is P0, P1 or P2 with file:line and a concrete input that shows it. HOLDOUT RULE: never open command-prompts.jsonl, holdout-prompts.jsonl or behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl except through jq 'del(.prompt)', never run git diff, show or log -p over a path that includes them without the pathspecs ':(exclude)**/command-prompts.jsonl' ':(exclude)**/holdout-prompts.jsonl' ':(exclude)**/behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl', never run score-command-transcripts.mjs --summary, and never print session text from a CLI session store. Never read or create .skilled/hooks/hook-flags.env. The reviewer changes no code and writes only inside its lineage folder."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-brief-6.txt\"}"},"time":{"start":1794815546182,"end":1794815547037}}}}
