:"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"332:    cwd: REPO_ROOT,\n527:    cwd: REPO_ROOT,\n553:    cwd: outDir,\n1069:      cwd: REPO_ROOT,\n1365:  const restore = options.dryRun ? null : restoreTurn({ cwd: REPO_ROOT, before: before.status });\n=== checkout ===\n37:// whatever keys HOME holds. A live arm additionally refuses to start in a checkout\n40:// keeps running in this checkout and its guards stay about file paths alone.\n58:// The arena builder writes this file into the checkout it made. Its absence is the\n67:// scorer reads it back from another checkout, so the locator records the resolved\n176:      // checkout, so passing the directory a second time would only fail.\n228:      // A fresh checkout has never been trusted interactively, and print mode has\n455:// row. The path is resolved so a log written from another checkout still opens.\n590: * @param {string} dir - The checkout the turn ran in.\n616:// because only that checkout has no remote, no outer repository and no dotenv file\n645: * @param {string} root - The checkout the turn runs in.\n650:  // A dry run spawns nothing and keeps running in this checkout, so it has no\n1295:  // checkout.\n1372:  const offer = replayOffer({ checkoutDir: PROJECT_DIR, prompt: job.prompt, sessionId });\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && grep -n \\\"cwd\\\\b\\\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs | head -30; echo '=== checkout ==='; grep -n \\\"checkout\\\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs | head -40\"}"},"time":{"start":1794815907687,"end":1794815908736}}}}
