{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794816069750,"sessionID":"ses_e1ca84ea7ffeYndeEpFMNWYowo","part":{"partID":"prt_1e35fca03002QMo7TL685ZKJtz","sessionID":"ses_e1ca84ea7ffeYndeEpFMNWYowo","messageID":"msg_1e35fb601001VFnSsp93y5H2SK","type":"tool","id":"call_7e5f63f4ee0640d8b85a171d","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && node -e \"\nconst fs=require('fs');\nconst r=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/deep-review-findings-registry.json','utf8'));\nconsole.log(Object.keys(r));\nconst open=r.openFindings||[];\nconsole.log('open',open.length,'resolved',(r.resolvedFindings||[]).length);\nfor(const f of [...open,...(r.resolvedFindings||[])]){\n  if(String(f.file||'').includes('score-command-transcripts')||String(f.title||'').toLowerCase().includes('start')){\n    console.log('-',f.severity,f.status||'',f.file,'::',f.title);\n  }\n}\n\" 2>&1 | head -60"},"output":"[\n  'mergedFrom',\n  'lineageExecutors',\n  'mergedVerdict',\n  'failedRequiredGateIds',\n  'openFindings',\n  'resolvedFindings',\n  'findingsBySeverity',\n  'openFindingsCount',\n  'resolvedFindingsCount',\n  'activeP0',\n  'activeP1',\n  'activeP2'\n]\nopen 164 resolved 5\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs :: --backfill replays a started-command row with the default fixture path even when the run used a custom --fixture\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs :: A --target-directory copy records the source as the file it changed\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs :: A 2> or &> redirect target that names a command document still counts as a start\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs :: A background & is folded into the writer's argument list\n- P2 active .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs :: A command that starts after a shell keyword or the command builtin is not read as a command start\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs :: A heredoc whose delimiter is not a bare identifier is read as commands\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs :: A mode suffix hides a command reported twice\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs :: A refusal that quotes the COMMAND: format is scored as a start\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs :: A shell read counts as a workflow load but not as a start or a loop\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs :: A started-command row selected by --row-id is logged under the pre arm\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs :: A three-backtick line closes a four-backtick fence\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs :: An arm named paired is silently hidden or overwritten by the summary pair block\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs :: In-place editors outside the fix's writer list stay invisible\n- P1 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs :: In-place shell edits are never write events, so unsafe and loopInit miss every write that is not a redirect\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs :: offerReached counts an unknown brief state as reached\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/README.md :: The advisor README calls the companion policy run/start/ask and omits the child form the renderer prints\n- P2 active .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml :: The embedder route probes OLLAMA_BASE_URL but starts and pulls against the default local host\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs :: The started-command set row ids are a second source of truth for labels the scorer reconstructs from a regex\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs :: The transcript scorer's header promises an ordered read/write report the CLI does not print\n- P2 active .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/codex-hook-approval-check.cjs :: The two sibling hook checks disagree on a value flag whose next token starts with a dash\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs :: The workflow block unscoredOnly count is never incremented\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"[\n  'mergedFrom',\n  'lineageExecutors',\n  'mergedVerdict',\n  'failedRequiredGateIds',\n  'openFindings',\n  'resolvedFindings',\n  'findingsBySeverity',\n  'openFindingsCount',\n  'resolvedFindingsCount',\n  'activeP0',\n  'activeP1',\n  'activeP2'\n]\nopen 164 resolved 5\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs :: --backfill replays a started-command row with the default fixture path even when the run used a custom --fixture\n- P2 active .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs :: A --target-directory copy records t