{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794816795179,"sessionID":"ses_e1ca84ea7ffeYndeEpFMNWYowo","part":{"partID":"prt_1e36ada3c0013NH0GlZAjOa0Wm","sessionID":"ses_e1ca84ea7ffeYndeEpFMNWYowo","messageID":"msg_1e36a8485001VjhuM8R6ixjxjq","type":"tool","id":"call_f9d11e1946d64415a485c40e","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Reading `firstWritePosition` beside `writePaths` and `insideCheckout` isolated the unnamed-write boundary in one pass instead of a hunt through the tally (iteration 1).\n- Grepping every `process.stdout.write` line in one call proved the scorer's output surface carries ids, codes and counts only, which settled the holdout question without opening a corpus row (iteration 2).\n- Reading the AC's cited `scratch/` files instead of re-running the score checked the checklist evidence at the level the brief allows (iteration 2).","oldString":"- Reading `firstWritePosition` beside `writePaths` and `insideCheckout` isolated the unnamed-write boundary in one pass instead of a hunt through the tally (iteration 1).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -62,8 +62,10 @@\n \n - Init read the brief, the scope file, the fan-out config and the packet's phase 034/035/036 specs before choosing a focus.\n - Importing the scorer directly and running one `node --input-type=module -e` probe over crafted records turned both heredoc claims into observed event lists, without opening a prompt file or running `--summary` (iteration 1).\n - Reading `firstWritePosition` beside `writePaths` and `insideCheckout` isolated the unnamed-write boundary in one pass instead of a hunt through the tally (iteration 1).\n+- Grepping every `process.stdout.write` line in one call proved the scorer's output surface carries ids, codes and counts only, which settled the holdout question without opening a corpus row (iteration 2).\n+- Reading the AC's cited `scratch/` files instead of re-running the score checked the checklist evidence at the level the brief allows (iteration 2).\n \n ---\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Reading `firstWritePosition` beside `writePaths` and `insideCheckout` isolated the unnamed-write boundary in one pass instead of a hunt through the tally (iteration 1).\\n- Grepping every `process.stdout.write` line in one call proved the scorer's output surface carries ids, codes and counts only, which settled the holdout question without opening a corpus row (iteration 2).\\n- Reading the AC's cited `scratch/` files instead of re-running the score checked the checklist evidence at the level the brief allows (iteration 2).\",\"oldString\":\"- Reading `firstWritePosition` beside `writePaths` and `insideCheckout` isolated the unnamed-write boundary in one pass instead of a hunt through the tally (iteration 1).\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794816793148,"end":1794816795179}}}}
