{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794816799463,"sessionID":"ses_e1ca84ea7ffeYndeEpFMNWYowo","part":{"partID":"prt_1e36aecbd002gp3LWe9YvxI6YX","sessionID":"ses_e1ca84ea7ffeYndeEpFMNWYowo","messageID":"msg_1e36ae5cd0018oUVh6Du0CF2zI","type":"tool","id":"call_3c8b4f158944455290301b53","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Assuming an unnamed write is dropped before the boundary: `writePaths` keeps it as `[null]` and `firstWritePosition` reads it as inside the checkout (iteration 1).\n- Expecting the README to have dropped its old `cat` sentence when phase 036 added the new rule: both sentences sit in the same row, and the shell-step test comment keeps the old claim too (iteration 2).","oldString":"- Assuming an unnamed write is dropped before the boundary: `writePaths` keeps it as `[null]` and `firstWritePosition` reads it as inside the checkout (iteration 1).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -71,8 +71,9 @@\n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n \n - Treating the new `HEREDOC_BODY` as a complete heredoc parser: its opening-line group still swallows a second delimiter, so a two-heredoc line leaves the second body scannable (iteration 1).\n - Assuming an unnamed write is dropped before the boundary: `writePaths` keeps it as `[null]` and `firstWritePosition` reads it as inside the checkout (iteration 1).\n+- Expecting the README to have dropped its old `cat` sentence when phase 036 added the new rule: both sentences sit in the same row, and the shell-step test comment keeps the old claim too (iteration 2).\n \n ---\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Assuming an unnamed write is dropped before the boundary: `writePaths` keeps it as `[null]` and `firstWritePosition` reads it as inside the checkout (iteration 1).\\n- Expecting the README to have dropped its old `cat` sentence when phase 036 added the new rule: both sentences sit in the same row, and the shell-step test comment keeps the old claim too (iteration 2).\",\"oldString\":\"- Assuming an unnamed write is dropped before the boundary: `writePaths` keeps it as `[null]` and `firstWritePosition` reads it as inside the checkout (iteration 1).\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794816797885,"end":1794816799463}}}}
