{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794816926966,"sessionID":"ses_e1ca84ea7ffeYndeEpFMNWYowo","part":{"partID":"prt_1e36ce0d9001BAtJ2SdXIspqib","sessionID":"ses_e1ca84ea7ffeYndeEpFMNWYowo","messageID":"msg_1e36cd4d3001dKG9CyivBwXIso","type":"tool","id":"call_d3a95001d9ef4170bff8a9ae","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && grep -rn \"synthesis_complete\\|synthesis-complete\" --include=*.yaml --include=*.cjs --include=*.md .skilled/commands/deep .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop | grep -v node_modules | head -20"},"output":".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/feature-catalog.md:86:Synthesis owns the final `research/research.md` output. It reads all iteration files and the final strategy state, compiles the standard 17-section research document, adds the required `Eliminated Alternatives` table, marks the config status complete, and appends a `synthesis_complete` event to the JSONL log.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/feature-catalog.md:211:`deep-research-state.jsonl` stores the config record, iteration records, and typed events such as `resumed`, `restarted`, `blocked_stop`, `graph_convergence`, and `synthesis_complete`. Iteration lines can carry `ruledOut`, `noveltyJustification`, `convergenceSignals`, `focusTrack`, `sourceStrength`, and `graphEvents`, and the reader contract explicitly tolerates malformed lines by skipping them with defaults.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/loop-lifecycle/synthesis.md:27:Negative knowledge is part of the live contract here. Synthesis must consolidate `ruledOut` entries and `Dead Ends` sections into a required `Eliminated Alternatives` table. It also updates the config status to `complete` and appends a `synthesis_complete` event so later tooling can tell the packet has reached terminal synthesis.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/state-management/jsonl-state-log.md:25:The JSONL log begins with a config record, then appends one line per iteration plus typed event records such as `resumed`, `restarted`, `blocked_stop`, `graph_convergence`, `userPaused`, and `synthesis_complete`. Iteration rows can carry `newInfoRatio`, `noveltyJustification`, `convergenceSignals`, `ruledOut`, `focusTrack`, `sourceStrength`, and `graphEvents`, which makes the log the richest machine-readable packet surface.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/changelog/v1.6.0.0.md:44:At emission, `step_normalize_pause_events` maps raw `paused` and `stuck_recovery` to `userPaused` and `stuckRecovery`. It uses the frozen `STOP_REASONS` enum. The live workflow no longer passes free-form strings into `synthesis_complete.stopReason`.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/changelog/v1.6.2.0.md:20:- **Dashboard status follows the latest `synthesis_complete` event.** `reduce-state.cjs` parses that event. It no longer derives status from stale config.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/protocol/loop-protocol.md:564:6. **Final JSONL entry**: `{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"synthesis_complete\",\"totalIterations\":N,\"answeredCount\":A,\"totalQuestions\":Q,\"stopReason\":\"converged\"}`\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/state/state-reducer-registry.md:170:`synthesis_complete` events are authoritative for terminal status when present.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/synthesis-save-and-guardrails/final-synthesis-memory-save-and-guardrail-behavior.md:48:1. `bash: rg -n 'generate-context.js|synthesis_complete|research/research.md|memory' .skilled/commands/deep/research.md .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/SKILL.md .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/README.md`\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/synthesis-save-and-guardrails/final-synthesis-memory-save-and-guardrail-behavior.md:50:3. `bash: rg -n 'phase_synthesis|phase_save|generate-context.js|synthesis_complete|wave|segment|direct_mode' .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/guides/quick-reference.md`\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/iteration-execution-and-state-discipline/progressive-synthesis-behavior-for-research-md.md:50:3. `bash: rg -n 'phase_synthesis|research_output|synthesis_complete' .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml`\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs:2286:  const latestSynthesisComplete = eventRecords.filter((record) => record.event === 'synthesis_complete').at(-1);\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:1065:// contract asks for `synthesis_complete`; the variants below were all observed in\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:1069:const SYNTHESIS_EVENT_NAMES = new Set(['synthesis_complete', 'phase_synthesis_complete', 'synthesis']);\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:1144:    // on one prompt: `synthesis_complete`, then `phase_synthesis_complete`, then\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs:531:    if (record.event === 'synthesis_complete') {\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs:577:    } else if (record.event === 'resumed' || record.event === 'restarted' || record.event === 'synthesis_complete') {\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs:1865:    if (record.type === 'iteration' || record.event === 'synthesis_complete') {\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs:436:      event: 'synthesis_complete',\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs:480:    event: 'synthesis_complete',\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/feature-catalog.md:86:Synthesis owns the final `research/research.md` output. It reads all iteration files and the final strategy state, compiles the standard 17-section research document, adds the required `Eliminated Alternatives` table, marks the config status complete, and appends a `synthesis_complete` event to the JSONL log.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/feature-catalog.md:211:`deep-research-state.jsonl` stores the config record, iteration records, and typed events such as `resumed`, `restarted`, `blocked_stop`, `graph_convergence`, and `synthesis_complete`. Iteration lines can carry `ruledOut`, `noveltyJustification`, `convergenceSignals`, `focusTrack`, `sourceStrength`, and `graphEvents`, and the reader contract explicitly tolerates malformed lines by skipping them with defaults.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/loop-lifecycle/synthesis.md:27:Negative knowledge is part of the live contract here. Synthesis must consolidate `ruledOut` entries and `Dead Ends` sections into a required `Eliminated Alternatives` table. It also updates the config status to `complete` and appends a `synthesis_complete` event so later tooling can tell the packet has reached terminal synthesis.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/state-management/jsonl-state-log.md:25:The JSONL log begins with a config record, then appends one line per iteration plus typed event records such as `resumed`, `restarted`, `blocked_stop`, `graph_convergence`, `userPaused`, and `synthesis_complete`. Iteration rows can carry `newInfoRatio`, `noveltyJustification`, `convergenceSignals`, `ruledOut`, `focusTrack`, `sourceStrength`, and `graphEvents`, which makes the log the richest machine-readable packet surface.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/changelog/v1.6.0.0.md:44:At emission, `step_normalize_pause_events` maps raw `paused` and `stuck_recovery` to `userPaused` and `stuckRecovery`. It uses the frozen `STOP_REASONS` enum. The live workflow no longer passes free-form strings into `synthesis_complete.stopReason`.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/changelog/v1.6.2.0.md:20:- **Dashboard status follows the latest `synthesis_complete` event.** `reduce-state.cjs` parses that event. It no longer derives status from stale config.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/protocol/loop-protocol.md:564:6. **Final JSONL entry**: `{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"synthesis_complete\",\"totalIterations\":N,\"answeredCount\":A,\"totalQuestions\":Q,\"stopReason\":\"converged\"}`\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/state/state-reducer-registry.md:170:`synthesis_complete` events are authoritative for terminal status when present.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/synthesis-save-and-guardrails/final-synthesis-memory-save-and-guardrail-behavior.md:48:1. `bash: rg -n 'generate-context.js|synthesis_complete|research/research.md|memory' .skilled/commands/deep/research.md .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/SKILL.md .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/README.md`\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/synthesis-save-and-guardrails/final-synthesis-memory-save-and-guardrail-behavior.md:50:3. `bash: rg -n 'phase_synthesis|phase_save|generate-context.js|synthesis_complete|wave|segment|direct_mode' .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/guides/quick-reference.md`\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/iteration-execution-and-state-discipline/progressive-synthesis-behavior-for-research-md.md:50:3. `bash: rg -n 'phase_synthesis|research_output|synthesis_complete' .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml`\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs:2286:  const latestSynthesisComplete = eventRecords.filter((record) => record.event === 'synthesis_complete').at(-1);\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:1065:// contract asks for `synthesis_complete`; the variants below were all observed in\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:1069:const SYNTHESIS_EVENT_NAMES = new Set(['synthesis_complete', 'phase_synthesis_complete', 'synthesis']);\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:1144:    // on one prompt: `synthesis_complete`, then `phase_synthesis_complete`, then\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs:531:    if (record.event === 'synthesis_complete') {\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs:577:    } else if (record.event === 'resumed' || record.event === 'restarted' || record.event === 'synthesis_complete') {\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs:1865:    if (record.type === 'iteration' || record.event === 'synthesis_complete') {\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs:436:      event: 'synthesis_complete',\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs:480:    event: 'synthesis_complete',\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && grep -rn \\\"synthesis_complete\\\\|synthesis-complete\\\" --include=*.yaml --include=*.cjs --include=*.md .skilled/commands/deep .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop | grep -v node_modules | head -20\"}"},"time":{"start":1794816925913,"end":1794816926966}}}}
