{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794816955420,"sessionID":"ses_e1ca84ea7ffeYndeEpFMNWYowo","part":{"partID":"prt_1e36d4eae002Ebm8HhMmchRRhx","sessionID":"ses_e1ca84ea7ffeYndeEpFMNWYowo","messageID":"msg_1e36d2f2d001DahC9oQfRkuZij","type":"tool","id":"call_6c0c591b6eef4adb86d036c8","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Reading the AC's cited `scratch/` files instead of re-running the score checked the checklist evidence at the level the brief allows (iteration 2).\n- Comparing `scoreRun`'s `@returns` union against the object it builds and the field `addScored` reads found the one contract the change left behind (iteration 3).","oldString":"- Reading the AC's cited `scratch/` files instead of re-running the score checked the checklist evidence at the level the brief allows (iteration 2).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -65,8 +65,9 @@\n - Importing the scorer directly and running one `node --input-type=module -e` probe over crafted records turned both heredoc claims into observed event lists, without opening a prompt file or running `--summary` (iteration 1).\n - Reading `firstWritePosition` beside `writePaths` and `insideCheckout` isolated the unnamed-write boundary in one pass instead of a hunt through the tally (iteration 1).\n - Grepping every `process.stdout.write` line in one call proved the scorer's output surface carries ids, codes and counts only, which settled the holdout question without opening a corpus row (iteration 2).\n - Reading the AC's cited `scratch/` files instead of re-running the score checked the checklist evidence at the level the brief allows (iteration 2).\n+- Comparing `scoreRun`'s `@returns` union against the object it builds and the field `addScored` reads found the one contract the change left behind (iteration 3).\n \n ---\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Reading the AC's cited `scratch/` files instead of re-running the score checked the checklist evidence at the level the brief allows (iteration 2).\\n- Comparing `scoreRun`'s `@returns` union against the object it builds and the field `addScored` reads found the one contract the change left behind (iteration 3).\",\"oldString\":\"- Reading the AC's cited `scratch/` files instead of re-running the score checked the checklist evidence at the level the brief allows (iteration 2).\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794816954030,"end":1794816955420}}}}
