tenv`, `copyPath`, `runCp`, `stampBuildTree` |\n\nEvery finding above is active. No finding was downgraded or resolved during the run.\n\n## 4. Remediation Workstreams\n\n### WS-1 Scorer write detection (P1, do first)\n1. Extend write detection beyond redirects and `apply_patch` so an in-place edit and a non-redirect writer produce a write event, or pass the runner's `changedPaths` into `startState`.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && sed -n '1,75p' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/review-report.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794816978312,"end":1794816978973}}}}
