{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794817088266,"sessionID":"ses_e1ca84ea7ffeYndeEpFMNWYowo","part":{"partID":"prt_1e36f4f1a002BqyWyMJnCOjrfn","sessionID":"ses_e1ca84ea7ffeYndeEpFMNWYowo","messageID":"msg_1e36f2d30001X780W1qzVVtAgb","type":"tool","id":"call_bc8455be1683484995f2770d","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"### State Integrity\n\n- Three iteration narratives, three delta files, three canonical records and three receipted ledger appends agree on iteration number, focus, dimension set and finding ids.\n- `deep-review-state.jsonl` is the gateway's projection; the lineage never wrote it directly.\n- The reducer ran after each iteration (exit 0) and owns the registry, the dashboard and the anchored strategy blocks.\n- The registry's `dimension` for `iter2-P2-old-start-rule-still-stated` reads `security` while its finding class is `traceability`: the reducer derives a finding's dimension from the first dimension name in the iteration focus, and iteration 2's focus names security first. The finding's own `dimension` and class in `findingDetails` and in `deltas/iter-002.jsonl` are `traceability`.\n- No file outside `review/lineages/scorer-6/` was created or modified by this lineage, and no review target file was touched; `git status --porcelain -- .skilled` is empty.","oldString":"### State Integrity\n\n- Three iteration narratives, three delta files, three canonical records and three receipted ledger appends agree on iteration number, focus, dimension set and finding ids.\n- `deep-review-state.jsonl` is the gateway's projection; the lineage never wrote it directly.\n- The reducer ran after each iteration (exit 0) and owns the registry, the dashboard and the anchored strategy blocks.\n- No file outside `review/lineages/scorer-6/` was created or modified by this lineage, and no review target file was touched.","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/review-report.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/review-report.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/review-report.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/review-report.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/review-report.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/review-report.md\n@@ -162,9 +162,10 @@\n \n - Three iteration narratives, three delta files, three canonical records and three receipted ledger appends agree on iteration number, focus, dimension set and finding ids.\n - `deep-review-state.jsonl` is the gateway's projection; the lineage never wrote it directly.\n - The reducer ran after each iteration (exit 0) and owns the registry, the dashboard and the anchored strategy blocks.\n-- No file outside `review/lineages/scorer-6/` was created or modified by this lineage, and no review target file was touched.\n+- The registry's `dimension` for `iter2-P2-old-start-rule-still-stated` reads `security` while its finding class is `traceability`: the reducer derives a finding's dimension from the first dimension name in the iteration focus, and iteration 2's focus names security first. The finding's own `dimension` and class in `findingDetails` and in `deltas/iter-002.jsonl` are `traceability`.\n+- No file outside `review/lineages/scorer-6/` was created or modified by this lineage, and no review target file was touched; `git status --porcelain -- .skilled` is empty.\n \n ### Holdout Statement\n \n No corpus, holdout or fresh prompt file was opened by this lineage. The probes imported the scorer module and passed crafted records in memory; the only evidence reads were the packet's `scratch/` text files and the packet's acceptance criteria.\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-6/review-report.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"### State Integrity\\n\\n- Three iteration narratives, three delta files, three canonical records and three receipted ledger appends agree on iteration number, focus, dimension set and finding ids.\\n- `deep-review-state.jsonl` is the gateway's projection; the lineage never wrote it directly.\\n- The reducer ran after each iteration (exit 0) and owns the registry, the dashboard and the anchored strategy blocks.\\n- The registry's `dimension` for `iter2-P2-old-start-rule-still-stated` reads `security` while its finding class is `traceability`: the reducer derives a finding's dimension from the first dimension name in the iteration focus, and iteration 2's focus names security first. The finding's own `dimension` and class in `findingDetails` and in `deltas/iter-002.jsonl` are `traceability`.\\n- No file outside `review/lineages/scorer-6/` was created or modified by this lineage, and no review target file was touched; `git status --porcelain -- .skilled` is empty.\",\"oldString\":\"### State Integrity\\n\\n- Three iteration narratives, three delta files, three canonical records and three receipted ledger appends agree on iteration number, focus, dimension set and finding ids.\\n- `deep-review-state.jsonl` is the gateway's projection; the lineage never wrote it directly.\\n- The reducer ran after each iteration (exit 0) and owns the registry, the dashboard and the anchored strategy blocks.\\n- No file outside `review/lineages/scorer-6/` was created or modified by this lineage